This repository holds the launchpad plugin loader: the plugin and marketplace
manifests, the skill loaders, and a bootstrap that activates a licence key and
installs launchpad on your machine. Installing it is free. Running launchpad
needs a licence key, bought once from the checkout linked in README.md, and
your use of it is governed by the terms at https://shiplaunchpad.com/terms/.

You may install this plugin and read anything it installs on your own machine.
You may not copy, redistribute, resell or publish this package, the licensed
pack it installs, or any part of either, except as those terms allow.

